# Demo: read-only walk through Treechat's logged-out flow. Types a name into
# the signup form but never submits it. Consecutive checks batch into one Jev
# request together with the next act/type.
open https://app.treechat.com/
check is this a login page?
check is there a password field?
refute is the user already logged in?
act go to create a new account
check is a sign-up form shown?
check does the form ask for a username, email and password?
refute is an error or "not found" page shown?
type the username field => jevb demo
check does the username field contain "jevb demo"?
refute is the password field filled in?
act go back to the login page
check is this a login page?
refute is an error or "not found" page shown?
